(text "R2 loads a capacitive sensor; this circuit DOES NOT preserve an unknown ignition plateau.\nNominal low-voltage model: gain ~0.909, HP ~1.45 Hz, LP ~7.96 kHz plus ~15.9 kHz.\nD1-D4 do not prove fault protection. No hot-plug/unpowered-input/24V/HV rating.\nLocal pin numbers only. Rail current, clamp recovery, stability, ground paths and board mapping TBD." (at 15.24 165.1 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0eb00ebb-ca36-5475-9e3d-e30527dd8465"))
